diff --git a/board/axera/ax650_master/README b/board/axera/ax650_master/README
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..f64898f4
--- /dev/null
+++ b/board/axera/ax650_master/README
@@ -0,0 +1,23 @@
+Introduction
+============
+
+AX650 key features we might use in U-Boot:
+* CPU: ARMv8 64bit MP4 architecture,
+* IRAM: 128KB
+* DRAM: 16GB-128MB dual-channel
+* eMMC: support eMMC 5.0/5.1, suport HS400, HS200, DDR50
+* SD/MMC: support SD 3.0, MMC 4.51
+* USB: USB3.0 typc-C port *2 with dwc3 controller
+*      USB2.0 EHCI host port *1
+* Display: RGB/HDMI/DP/MIPI/EDP
+
+master key features:
+* debug console: UART0
+
+Here is the step-by-step to boot to U-Boot on AX650.
+
+Compile the U-Boot
+==================
+
+
+You should be able to get U-Boot log message in console/UART0 now.
